{"schema":1,"revision":91826091,"page":{"pageid":7209883,"title":"薄荷","displayTitle":"薄荷","variant":"zh-tw"},"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"zh-Hant-TW\" dir=\"ltr\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r95173172\">.mw-parser-output .hatnote{font-size:small}.mw-parser-output div.hatnote{padding-left:2em;margin-bottom:0.8em;margin-top:0.8em}.mw-parser-output .hatnote-notice-img::after{content:\"\\202f \\202f \\202f \\202f \"}.mw-parser-output .hatnote-notice-img-small::after{content:\"\\202f \\202f \"}.mw-parser-output .hatnote+.mw-empty-elt+.hatnote{margin-top:-0.5em}body.skin-minerva .mw-parser-output .hatnote-notice-img,body.skin-minerva .mw-parser-output .hatnote-notice-img-small{display:none}@media print{body.ns-0 .mw-parser-output .hatnote{display:none!important}}</style><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote navigation-not-searchable\"><span class=\"noviewer hatnote-notice-img\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wikipedia:%E6%B6%88%E6%AD%A7%E4%B9%89\" title=\"Wikipedia:消歧義\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5f/Disambig_gray.svg/40px-Disambig_gray.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5f/Disambig_gray.svg/60px-Disambig_gray.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"220\" data-file-height=\"168\" /></a></span>此條目介紹的是廣布於亞洲東部與北美洲的狹義薄荷。關於廣義薄荷，請見「<b><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%96%84%E8%8D%B7%E5%B1%AC\" title=\"薄荷屬\">薄荷屬</a></b>」。</div>\n<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r95173172\" /><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote navigation-not-searchable\"><span class=\"noviewer hatnote-notice-img\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wikipedia:%E6%B6%88%E6%AD%A7%E4%B9%89\" title=\"Wikipedia:消歧義\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5f/Disambig_gray.svg/40px-Disambig_gray.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5f/Disambig_gray.svg/60px-Disambig_gray.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"220\" data-file-height=\"168\" /></a></span>關於2018年<a href=\"/wiki/%E7%9A%AE%E5%9F%83%E5%B0%94%C2%B7%E8%8E%AB%E7%91%9E%E5%B0%94\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"皮埃爾·莫瑞爾\">皮埃爾·莫瑞爾</a>執導美國電影，請見「<b><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%96%84%E8%8D%B7_(%E7%94%B5%E5%BD%B1)\" title=\"薄荷 (電影)\">薄荷 (電影)</a></b>」。</div>\n<table class=\"infobox biota\" style=\"text-align: left; width: 200px; font-size: 100%\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align: center; background-color: rgb(180,250,180)\">薄荷<span class=\"plainlinks\" style=\"font-size:smaller; float:right; padding-right:0.4em; margin-left:-3em; margin-top:0.05em;\"><span class=\"skin-invert notpageimage\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Help:%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E9%96%B1%E8%AE%80%E7%94%9F%E7%89%A9%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A%E6%A1%86\" title=\"Help:如何閱讀生物資訊框\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a5/Infobox_info_icon2.svg/20px-Infobox_info_icon2.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a5/Infobox_info_icon2.svg/40px-Infobox_info_icon2.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"160\" data-file-height=\"160\" /></a></span></span>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Mentha_canadensis.jpg\" clas